        "name": "KubeDash | Kubernetes Dashboard",
        "alias": null,
        "accountGrade": 9.3,
        "description": "KubeDash | Kubernetes Dashboard delivers a customer-facing analytics surface over existing transactional data.\n\nThe build covers a semantic layer over the reporting replica, a set of curated dashboards for store performance, inventory turnover and per-SKU margin, and a scheduled export pipeline for finance. Access is role-scoped so a regional manager sees only their own territory.\n\nThe team is responsible for the data model, the API layer, and the dashboard implementation. The client retains ownership of data quality upstream of the replica, and of any changes to the source schema. Ongoing support after go-live is covered by a separate retainer and is not part of this Statement of Work.",
